      "created_at": "2013-01-01T21:12:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello,&nbsp;so I received my copy of EE yesterday, playing my 4th game (3rd solo now), my first impression is the amazing artwork!!!&nbsp; Alll the artwork is great, but so far my favorite is a card in Haka's deck (I think it is called Haka of Shield), where he is eating a sandwich.&nbsp; This is the first game that I ordered through the mail since 1992 (I'm not a huge gamer), well worth the wait.&nbsp; And a note + a promo card from Christopher (&gt;Games)&nbsp;was really cool.&nbsp; Thank you!&nbsp;</p>",
